# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the AddressSanitizer test runs. Every entry needs a reason.

# libX11 keeps its locale and text-conversion caches for the life of the process; they are allocated the
# first time a window title is set (detached panel windows) and never freed. Not a Spinus leak.
leak:juce::XWindowSystem::setTitle

# libX11's other internal caches (input method and locale data), allocated when windows open, e.g. plugin
# windows. tests/CMakeLists.txt links libX11 into the ASan test build so these frames can be named.
leak:libX11.so

# fontconfig keeps the patterns of a fallback-font lookup (e.g. for a "●" a font lacks) in its caches for the
# life of the process. Not a Spinus leak.
leak:libfontconfig.so
